Changes:
- renamed c11threads.h to threads.h
- changed the default implementation to POSIX threads
- the Win32 implementation is not distributed as part of llvm_moduly, but it still can be used if compiled separately
  > to do so define C11THREADS_WIN32 macro before including threads.h